WEBVTT

00:07.793 --> 00:08.965
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.034 --> 00:10.586
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.655 --> 00:12.068
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.137 --> 00:14.034
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.103 --> 00:16.896
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:16.965 --> 00:19.172
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.241 --> 00:21.000
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.068 --> 00:23.034
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.103 --> 00:24.758
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:24.827 --> 00:27.068
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.137 --> 00:28.862
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:28.931 --> 00:31.137
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.206 --> 00:33.379
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.448 --> 00:35.206
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.275 --> 00:37.379
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.448 --> 00:39.103
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.172 --> 00:40.620
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.689 --> 00:42.482
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.551 --> 00:45.034
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.103 --> 00:47.517
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:47.586 --> 00:49.517
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:49.586 --> 00:53.379
[folksy music]
[民谣音乐]

00:53.448 --> 01:00.517
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:01.517 --> 01:04.344
- [struggling]
- [挣扎]

01:04.413 --> 01:06.137
- [meows]
- [喵]

01:08.793 --> 01:11.482
[both groan]
[两人都呻吟]

01:11.551 --> 01:13.482
- Okay,
that's enough stretching.
- 好吧，
拉伸就足够了。

01:13.551 --> 01:14.827
- [meow]
- [喵]

01:14.896 --> 01:16.896
- Now we're ready
for a morning jog.
- 现在我们准备好了
晨跑。

01:16.965 --> 01:18.620
- Meow!
- 喵！

01:18.689 --> 01:21.655
- [heavy breathing]
- [粗重的呼吸]

01:21.724 --> 01:23.655
Ahh!
[crash, thud]
啊！
[撞击声、重击声]

01:25.551 --> 01:27.689
What's the matter, Gary?
Don't you like jogging?
怎么了，加里？
你不喜欢跑步吗？

01:27.758 --> 01:31.620
- Meow, meow, meow.
- Oh, right. You're a snail.
- 喵，喵，喵。
- 哦，对了。你是一只蜗牛。

01:31.689 --> 01:34.482
Hm. We've got to find
a way to get you moving.
嗯。我们必须找到
一种让你动起来的方法。

01:35.517 --> 01:37.137
[banging]
[砰砰]

01:37.206 --> 01:39.827
This should do it.
You'll "tank" me later.
这应该可以做到。
稍后你会“坦克”我。

01:39.896 --> 01:42.000
[laughing]
[笑]

01:44.758 --> 01:47.068
Hey, now you're moving.
嘿，现在你要搬家了。

01:47.137 --> 01:50.068
- Meow, meow!
- Whoa--ow!
- 喵，喵！
- 哇哦！

01:50.137 --> 01:53.034
I'm okay.
Ow!
我没事。
噢！

01:53.103 --> 01:54.034
Ow!
噢！

01:54.103 --> 01:55.137
Yow!
哟！

01:55.206 --> 01:58.413
[groaning]
- [meowing]
[呻吟]
- [喵喵叫]

02:01.206 --> 02:02.827
- Meow!
- 喵！

02:03.862 --> 02:07.000
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:07.068 --> 02:09.724
- [pained moaning]
- [痛苦的呻吟]

02:12.344 --> 02:14.034
Aww, poor Gary.
哇哦，可怜的加里。

02:14.103 --> 02:16.275
Looks like you
could use a leg up.
看起来像你
可以用一条腿抬起来。

02:16.344 --> 02:19.862
Or maybe two.
- [whimpers]
或者也许是两个。
- [呜咽]

02:19.931 --> 02:23.862
[saw buzzing]
[看到嗡嗡声]

02:23.931 --> 02:26.896
[grinding]
[研磨]

02:26.965 --> 02:29.517
- There! A perfect set of legs.
- 那里！一双完美的腿。

02:31.000 --> 02:32.758
Now let's make some for you.
现在让我们为您做一些。

02:34.896 --> 02:37.310
This will only hurt
for a second.
这只会伤害
一会儿。

02:37.379 --> 02:38.827
Yow!
哟！

02:40.517 --> 02:41.793
- Meow!
- 喵！

02:42.793 --> 02:44.379
Meow.
喵。

02:45.758 --> 02:46.689
- Voilà.
- 瞧。

02:46.758 --> 02:48.379
What do you think, Gary?
你觉得怎么样，加里？

02:48.448 --> 02:50.103
- Me-ow, meow-meow.
- 喵呜，喵喵。

02:50.172 --> 02:51.896
- Let's try 'em out.
- 让我们尝试一下。

02:51.965 --> 02:54.758
Come on.
Come to SpongeBob.
快点。
来海绵宝宝吧

02:54.827 --> 02:56.448
- Mm.
- 毫米。

02:56.517 --> 02:58.724
- Oh, your first steps.
- Meow.
- 哦，你的第一步。
- 喵。

02:58.793 --> 03:00.896
- My little guy's growing up.
- 我的小家伙长大了。

03:01.655 --> 03:04.344
Now let's try something
a little harder.
现在让我们尝试一下
有点难。

03:07.034 --> 03:08.655
[creaking]
[吱吱作响]

03:10.862 --> 03:12.482
- Meow, meow, meow.
- 喵，喵，喵。

03:12.551 --> 03:15.206
- Ooh, not bad.
Try this.
- 哦，还不错。
试试这个。

03:15.275 --> 03:17.724
[Irish jig music]
[爱尔兰吉格音乐]

03:17.793 --> 03:19.862
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:19.931 --> 03:23.241
- Meow, meow, meow, meooow!
- 喵，喵，喵，喵！

03:24.206 --> 03:26.344
- Nice moves.
- 动作不错。

03:26.413 --> 03:29.931
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:30.000 --> 03:32.310
Ow! Ah!
噢！啊!

03:32.379 --> 03:36.275
[gasps] The student has
surpassed the master.
[喘气] 学生有
超越了大师。

03:37.482 --> 03:39.896
Ready to stretch your stuff,
Gare-bear?
准备好伸展你的东西，
车站熊？

03:39.965 --> 03:41.551
- Meow, meow.
Meow!
- 喵，喵。
喵！

03:41.620 --> 03:43.827
- Hey, wait!
Whoa!
- 嘿，等等！
哇！

03:43.896 --> 03:47.103
- Meow, meow.
- Oh! Oy.
- 喵，喵。
- 哦！哎哟。

03:50.620 --> 03:53.310
After you.
- Meow, meow.
您先请。
- 喵，喵。

03:53.379 --> 03:55.620
all: [gasping]
- Oh, yeah, that's right.
全体：[喘气]
- 哦，是的，没错。

03:55.689 --> 03:58.034
You're not dreaming.
Check it out.
你不是在做梦。
一探究竟。

03:58.103 --> 03:59.517
Snail with legs, people.
有腿的蜗牛，人们。

03:59.586 --> 04:02.758
- Meow.
[growls flirtatiously]
- 喵。
[growls flirtatiously]

04:02.827 --> 04:04.310
- [purrs]
- [呼噜声]

04:04.379 --> 04:05.931
- Would you look at that.
- 你能看一下吗？

04:06.000 --> 04:08.586
- Well,
that's certainly different.
- 嗯，
这当然是不同的。

04:08.655 --> 04:11.034
- [hisses]
- [嘶嘶声]

04:11.103 --> 04:12.758
- [barks]
- [吠叫]

04:12.827 --> 04:14.620
- Oh!
- 哦！

04:14.689 --> 04:16.448
- [gasps] Gary!
- [喘气]加里！

04:16.517 --> 04:18.793
- Hey, control your snail,
fella.
- 嘿，控制你的蜗牛，
伙计。

04:18.862 --> 04:22.413
- Sorry. Guess Gary's new legs
got him a little excited.
- 对不起。猜猜加里的新腿
让他有点兴奋。

04:22.482 --> 04:23.931
- [blows raspberry]
- [吹覆盆子]

04:24.000 --> 04:25.931
- [hissing]
Pow!
- [嘶嘶声]
噗！

04:26.000 --> 04:30.655
- You'll be hearing
from my lawyer!
- 你会听到
来自我的律师！

04:30.724 --> 04:34.137
- What is your problem, man?
- [growling]
- 你有什么问题吗，伙计？
- [咆哮]

04:34.206 --> 04:35.517
- Ah!
- 啊！

04:35.586 --> 04:37.586
- Oh, wh--s--sorry!
- 噢，什——抱歉！

04:37.655 --> 04:41.344
- Ah!
- His legs!
- 啊！
- 他的腿！

04:41.413 --> 04:45.482
- Gary the snail,
that was very naughty.
- 蜗牛加里，
那是非常顽皮的。

04:45.551 --> 04:47.517
- Meow.
- Oh. [laughing]
- 喵。
- 哦。 [笑]

04:47.586 --> 04:50.068
I can't stay mad at you.
- Meow!
我不能一直生你的气。
- 喵！

04:50.137 --> 04:51.344
- Whoa!
- 哇！

04:55.103 --> 04:58.413
[exhausted moans]
[疲惫的呻吟声]

04:58.482 --> 05:00.344
I'm a little beat, Gary.
我有点沮丧，加里。

05:00.413 --> 05:02.275
Can you give me
a hand with the door?
你能给我吗
一只手拿着门？

05:02.344 --> 05:04.241
- Meow-ow.
- 喵呜。

05:06.068 --> 05:07.689
[struggling]
[挣扎]

05:07.758 --> 05:09.862
- Looks like I should
give you a hand, huh?
- 看来我应该
帮你一把，嗯？

05:10.793 --> 05:13.655
- Hm? Hm. Hmm.
- 嗯？嗯。唔。

05:14.482 --> 05:17.344
Uh-huh.
Uh-huh. Yow!
嗯嗯。
嗯嗯。哟！

05:19.517 --> 05:21.724
They look a little tight
in the shoulder.
它们看起来有点紧
在肩膀上。

05:21.793 --> 05:23.724
- Meow-meow,
meow-meow.
- 喵喵，
喵喵。

05:23.793 --> 05:27.482
- Whoops! I accidentally
gave you two left hands.
- 哎呀！我一不小心
给了你两只左手。

05:27.551 --> 05:28.620
Boop!
噗！

05:28.689 --> 05:32.172
Perfect. Give 'em
a test drive, Gary.
完美的。给他们
试驾一下，加里。

05:32.241 --> 05:35.724
- Meow, meow, meow...
- 喵，喵，喵……

05:35.793 --> 05:38.137
[struggling]
[挣扎]

05:38.206 --> 05:40.103
- Maybe you just
need some motivation.
-也许你只是
需要一些动力。

05:40.172 --> 05:43.379
- Meow.
[grunting]
- 喵。
[咕噜声]

05:44.724 --> 05:45.827
Meow!
喵！

05:45.896 --> 05:48.241
- [yelps]
You're doing it, Gary.
- [尖叫声]
你正在做，加里。

05:48.310 --> 05:50.655
Yes, yes!
Keep it up, keep it up!
是的，是的！
坚持下去，坚持下去！

05:50.724 --> 05:53.310
Ow! Yes, yes!
- Meow!
噢！是的，是的！
- 喵！

05:53.379 --> 05:56.379
- That's it, Gary.
Move the--move the--
- 就是这样，加里。
动一下——动一下——

05:56.448 --> 05:59.517
Move those arms.
移动那些手臂。

06:00.241 --> 06:02.344
- [giggling]
Meow-ow-ow-ow-ow-ow.
- [咯咯笑]
喵-喔-喔-喔-喔-喔。

06:05.448 --> 06:07.586
Meow?
Meow.
喵？
喵。

06:08.827 --> 06:13.310
[laughter]
[笑声]

06:13.379 --> 06:15.482
- [imitates a train]
- [模仿火车]

06:17.344 --> 06:20.896
- [nonsensical whining]
- [无意义的抱怨]

06:20.965 --> 06:22.965
- Meow.
- 喵。

06:23.034 --> 06:26.448
[chewing noises]
[咀嚼声]

06:26.517 --> 06:29.931
- One weekend
of pampering later.
- 一个周末
以后的宠爱。

06:31.310 --> 06:33.655
- [sipping]
- [啜饮]

06:38.275 --> 06:40.931
[ringing]
Ow!
[铃声]
噢！

06:41.000 --> 06:44.413
Yikes! Look at the time!
I gotta get to the Krusty Krab.
哎呀！看看时间！
我得去蟹堡王店了

06:44.482 --> 06:46.000
Thanks for spoiling me, Gary.
谢谢你宠我，加里。

06:46.068 --> 06:49.344
I didn't have
to lift a "finger."
我没有
举起“手指”。

06:52.896 --> 06:55.068
My fingers...
我的手指...

06:55.137 --> 06:57.827
[groans] Wha--!
[呻吟] 什——！

06:57.896 --> 07:02.931
A whole weekend of pampering
has left my limbs in limbo.
整个周末的呵护
让我的四肢陷入困境。

07:03.000 --> 07:06.620
Got. To go. To work.
得到。去吧。去工作。

07:12.827 --> 07:15.413
Hm?
嗯？

07:15.482 --> 07:18.413
[dramatic piano music]
[戏剧性的钢琴音乐]

07:18.482 --> 07:21.379
[struggling]
[挣扎]

07:21.448 --> 07:25.310
Too weak to flip
Krabby Patties.
太弱了，无法翻转
蟹肉饼。

07:25.379 --> 07:28.965
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

07:29.034 --> 07:32.482
- Ooh.
Uh-oh.
- 哦。
呃哦。

07:32.551 --> 07:35.448
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

07:35.517 --> 07:40.413
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:40.482 --> 07:42.310
[elastic stretching]
【弹性拉伸】

07:42.379 --> 07:43.724
- Hm.
- 嗯。

07:43.793 --> 07:47.896
Excuse me,
but I would like to complain!
对不起，
但我想投诉！

07:47.965 --> 07:51.620
- I see. Well the Krusty Krab
takes customer feedback
- 我懂了。那么蟹堡王
接受客户反馈

07:51.689 --> 07:53.724
very seriously, sir.
非常认真，先生。

07:53.793 --> 07:56.896
After they pay
the $5 complaint fee.
他们付款后
5 美元的投诉费。

07:56.965 --> 07:59.344
- All right, fine.
- 好吧，好吧。

07:59.413 --> 08:02.965
- Yee-hee-hee-hee.
- 嘿嘿嘿嘿。

08:03.034 --> 08:04.068
Thank you, sir.
谢谢您，先生。

08:04.137 --> 08:06.310
Now what seems to be
your problem?
现在看来是这样的
你的问题？

08:06.379 --> 08:08.931
- There is slime on my patty.
- 我的肉饼上有粘液。

08:09.000 --> 08:12.068
And mine has--[munching]
slime on it, too.
我的有--[咀嚼]
上面还有粘液。

08:12.137 --> 08:14.655
- My patty doesn't
have enough slime! [laughing]
- 我的肉饼没有
有足够的史莱姆！ [笑]

08:14.724 --> 08:17.655
- What?
Give me that.
- 什么？
给我那个。

08:17.724 --> 08:20.172
Bleh! Ugh! Gah!
哎呀！啊!嘎！

08:20.241 --> 08:24.344
SpongeBob! Just what do you
think you're doing
海绵宝宝！只是你做什么
认为你在做

08:24.413 --> 08:27.172
changing me patty...formula?
改变我的小馅饼...配方？

08:27.241 --> 08:29.482
- Meow. Meow-mow.
- 喵。喵喵。

08:29.551 --> 08:32.137
- Squidward!
Why is there a mollusk
- 章鱼哥！
为什么有软体动物

08:32.206 --> 08:33.724
cooking me Krabby Patties?
给我做蟹黄饼？

08:33.793 --> 08:37.000
- I thought it was strangely
quiet and peaceful today.
- 我觉得这很奇怪
今天安静祥和。

08:37.068 --> 08:38.965
- Where the halibut
is SpongeBob?
- 大比目鱼在哪里
是海绵宝宝吗？

08:39.034 --> 08:41.448
- Maybe he quit?
Or got hit by a bus?!
- 也许他辞职了？
还是被公交车撞了？！

08:41.517 --> 08:43.724
Or caught
a terminal disease!
或者被抓住
绝症！

08:43.793 --> 08:46.620
- I don't care if he turned
into a bucket of chum.
- 我不在乎他是否转身
放入一桶密友中。

08:46.689 --> 08:49.517
I need me fry cook!
我需要我炒菜！

08:49.586 --> 08:51.310
Mr. Squidward,
you have the helm.
章鱼哥先生，
你掌舵。

08:51.379 --> 08:56.517
- Attention Krusty Krab
customers: Get out.
- 注意蟹堡王
顾客：滚出去。

08:56.586 --> 08:58.413
It's time for my break.
我的休息时间到了。

08:58.482 --> 09:00.586
[irritated chatter]
[恼怒的喋喋不休]

09:00.655 --> 09:03.000
- SpongeBob!
- 海绵宝宝！

09:03.068 --> 09:04.896
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

09:04.965 --> 09:08.275
SpongeBob?
Are you okay in there?
海绵宝宝？
你在里面还好吗？

09:08.344 --> 09:09.965
You catch the flu or something?
你得了流感还是别的什么？

09:10.034 --> 09:13.586
Ugh.
Are you at death's door?
啊。
你正濒临死亡之门吗？

09:13.655 --> 09:15.655
Because you know darn well
they ain't
因为你非常了解
他们不是

09:15.724 --> 09:18.482
valid excuses
to miss work!
有效的借口
错过工作！

09:18.551 --> 09:20.655
- [meowing]
- [喵喵叫]

09:22.655 --> 09:26.827
- Ah! SpongeBob has gone
full raving loony.
- 啊！海绵宝宝走了
完全疯狂的疯子。

09:26.896 --> 09:29.103
Uh-oh!
- Meow-meow-meow-meow
呃-哦！
- 喵喵喵喵

09:29.172 --> 09:33.103
meow-meow-meow.
Meow-meow-meow-meow-meow-meow.
喵喵喵。
喵-喵-喵-喵-喵-喵。

09:34.413 --> 09:36.517
- [purring]
- [咕噜声]

09:44.275 --> 09:46.931
- [gasps, whirring]
- [喘气，呼呼]

09:47.000 --> 09:49.758
What in the name
of Neptune's nostrils
名字里有什么
海王星的鼻孔

09:49.827 --> 09:51.551
is going on in here?
这里发生什么事了？

09:51.620 --> 09:54.137
SpongeBob, you're acting
like you're the pet
海绵宝宝，你演戏了
就像你是宠物一样

09:54.206 --> 09:56.413
and that darn snail
is the owner.
还有那该死的蜗牛
是业主。

09:56.482 --> 09:58.896
- Meow! Meow-meow-meow.
- 喵！喵喵喵。

09:58.965 --> 10:00.586
- Bad snail.
Down boy.
- 坏蜗牛。
沮丧的男孩。

10:00.655 --> 10:02.862
- [hissing]
- SpongeBob, what are you--
- [嘶嘶声]
- 海绵宝宝，你是什么——

10:04.448 --> 10:06.448
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

10:06.517 --> 10:09.000
Snap out of it, SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝，振作起来！

10:12.000 --> 10:13.965
- [sniffing]
- [嗅嗅]

10:15.482 --> 10:17.275
Mr. Krabs?
蟹老板？

10:17.344 --> 10:19.931
- Have you completely
lost your mind, boy-o?
- 你完全
你疯了吗，小伙子？

10:20.000 --> 10:23.000
Snails ain't supposed
to have arms and legs.
蜗牛不应该
有胳膊和腿。

10:23.068 --> 10:26.379
- Aw, but Gary is so happy
with his new limbs.
- 哦，但是加里很高兴
和他的新四肢。

10:26.448 --> 10:27.965
- [sighs happily]
- [高兴地叹气]

10:28.034 --> 10:29.551
- Oh, is he?
- 哦，是吗？

10:29.620 --> 10:32.517
Well it's time
to cut this nonsense.
是时候了
废话少说。

10:32.586 --> 10:34.000
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

10:34.068 --> 10:36.034
- Ay! [grunting]
- 哎呀！ [咕噜声]

10:36.103 --> 10:38.551
- [hissing]
- [嘶嘶声]

10:38.620 --> 10:40.241
- Huh-hah!
- 哈哈！

10:41.379 --> 10:43.827
[snapping]
[啪啪啪]

10:45.655 --> 10:48.034
- Meow.
- 喵。

10:48.103 --> 10:51.172
- Mr. Krabs,
I'm sorry I forgot who I was.
- 蟹老板先生，
抱歉我忘记了我是谁。

10:51.241 --> 10:52.724
- That's okay, boy-o.
- 没关系，小伙子。

10:52.793 --> 10:57.172
- And Gary, I am so sorry
I tried to change you.
- 加里，我很抱歉
我试图改变你。

10:57.241 --> 10:59.862
- [belches]
- [打嗝]

10:59.931 --> 11:03.793
- And Patrick, I'm sorry I
haven't returned your hat yet.
- 帕特里克，我很抱歉
你的帽子还没归还。

11:05.413 --> 11:07.206
- [sobbing]
- [抽泣]

11:07.275 --> 11:09.862
It's okay...
没关系...

11:09.931 --> 11:13.068
- Hm? Well, I guess I shouldn't
let these go to waste.
- 嗯？嗯，我想我不应该
让这些都浪费掉吧。

11:13.137 --> 11:16.310
I can always use
an extra hand. [laughing]
我可以随时使用
额外的一手。 [笑]

11:16.379 --> 11:18.689
- All right, all right.
That's enough Sponge-bobbery
- 好吧，好吧。
海绵宝宝就够了

11:18.758 --> 11:20.103
for today, boy-o.
今天，小伙子。

11:20.172 --> 11:22.862
Time to get you
flipping patties again.
是时候来接你了
再次翻转肉饼。

11:25.000 --> 11:28.241
- Ah, sure is nice having
everything back to normal,
- 啊，当然很高兴拥有
一切恢复正常，

11:28.310 --> 11:29.620
isn't it Gare-bear?
这不是加雷熊吗？

11:29.689 --> 11:32.034
Yup.
Same old, same old.
是的。
老样子，老样子。

11:36.482 --> 11:38.103
- Meow-ow.
- 喵呜。

11:38.172 --> 11:40.206
[both sigh]
[两人叹气]

11:40.275 --> 11:42.068
- Meow.
Meow.
- 喵。
喵。

11:42.137 --> 11:44.689
- Oops! Sorry.
Boop-boop.
- 哎呀！对不起。
噗噗。

11:45.068 --> 11:48.931
[ukulele music]
[尤克里里音乐]

11:49.000 --> 11:56.206
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

♪ ♪